{"id":2217,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:46","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2217"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:17:08","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:17:08","slug":"large-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/large-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Large Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"347\"><strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"345\">Heavy-Duty Large Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"402\">Large Cardboard Boxes are an essential packaging choice for businesses handling bulk goods, storage needs, or oversized shipments. Their strong build and spacious interior allow products of different categories to be shipped safely and efficiently. From warehouse use to e-commerce delivery, these boxes offer practical solutions for moving, storing, and protecting items.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"745\">At <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"462\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a>, we provide <strong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"507\">Custom Large Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> at wholesale rates. Options include corrugated strength, double-wall protection, and multiple closure styles. Sizes can be fully customized, and we also offer printing and coating finishes that improve both durability and presentation.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"750\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"794\">Shapes and styles beyond the standard<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"1242\">Packaging does not always come in simple square or rectangular forms. Creative structures such as <strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"988\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/hexagon-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"986\">Hexagon Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> add variety and improve product display. While large boxes excel in bulk and storage, unique shapes are used for gifting, specialty goods, or retail presentation. Both categories highlight how cardboard packaging can be adapted to suit different uses.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"2831\">\n<thead data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1478\">\n<tr data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1478\">\n<th data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1321\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1367\" data-col-size=\"md\">Options Available<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1397\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Material Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Finishing Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1478\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applications<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"2831\">\n<tr data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1862\">\n<td data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1701\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box Sizes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1749\" data-col-size=\"md\">Medium, Large, Extra-Large, Custom Dimensions<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1779\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated Cardboard, Kraft<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1862\" data-col-size=\"md\">Shipping, Storage, Retail<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"2055\">\n<td data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1895\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strength Levels<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1941\" data-col-size=\"md\">Single-Wall, Double-Wall, Triple-Wall<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1972\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Recycled Cardboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2006\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lamination, Anti-Scratch Coats<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2055\" data-col-size=\"md\">E-commerce packaging, Moving boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2249\">\n<td data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2088\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Printing Options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2134\" data-col-size=\"md\">Full-Color CMYK, Pantone, Plain<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">High-Quality Inks<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2200\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Embossing, Foil, Raised Ink<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2249\" data-col-size=\"md\">Branding, Company Logos, Promotional Uses<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2443\">\n<td data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2282\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure Styles<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2328\" data-col-size=\"md\">Tuck-Top, Flap-Top, Self-Locking<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2359\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard Kraft Board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Perforated or Window Cutouts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2443\" data-col-size=\"md\">Storage Units, Product Displays<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2637\">\n<td data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2476\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Durability Features<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2522\" data-col-size=\"md\">Heavy-Duty Load Bearing, Moisture Resistant<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2553\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rigid Corrugated Fiberboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2588\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Protective Laminations<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2637\" data-col-size=\"md\">Industrial use, Long-distance Transportation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2831\">\n<td data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2670\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eco-Friendly Options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2716\" data-col-size=\"md\">Available in Recyclable Grades<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eco Kraft &amp; Recycled Paper<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte Eco Laminate<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2831\" data-col-size=\"md\">Sustainable packaging initiatives<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2836\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2880\">Key benefits of large cardboard boxes<\/h2>\n<ol data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"3132\">\n<li data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2933\">\n<p data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2933\">High load-bearing capacity for bulky products.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2984\">\n<p data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2984\">Flexible in dimension to meet shipping needs.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3034\">\n<p data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3034\">Suitable for both industrial and retail use.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3083\">\n<p data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3083\">Cost-efficient packaging solution at scale.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3132\">\n<p data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3132\">Available with branding and print finishes.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3137\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3186\">Packaging across size and shape<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3585\">Large cardboard containers belong to a broader collection of options designed for different needs. The <strong data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3414\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3412\">Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape<\/a><\/strong> allows users to compare large, small, specialty, and uniquely cut boxes. This helps businesses choose packaging that suits both utility and presentation goals.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3684\">Order your <strong data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3649\">Large Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> today from Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3879\">\n<li data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3745\">\n<p data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3745\">Options available in Gloss, Matte, or Spot UV finishes.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3746\" data-end=\"3782\">\n<p data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3782\">Free design assistance included.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3828\">\n<p data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3828\">Flexible sizing and box strength choices.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3879\">\n<p data-start=\"3831\" data-end=\"3879\">Quick turnaround and free nationwide delivery.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"4066\">Whether you need <strong data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3929\">extra large cardboard boxes<\/strong> for industrial use or <strong data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3984\">custom large cardboard boxes<\/strong> for retail shipping, we provide strong, reliable, and cost-effective solutions.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for large cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. Our large cardboard boxes are perfect for moving, storage, and shipping large items. We offer a variety of sizes and styles to fit your needs. Our boxes are made from high-quality materials and are printed with high-quality inks. We also offer various coating options, including gloss, matte, and spot UV. We offer free design and shipping on all orders. Custom sizes and styles are available. Fast turnaround times. Order today and experience our premium products and top-notch customer service!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2247,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[179],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2217","product","type-product","status-publis